[Music]  last wednesday was national corvette day  to celebrate i met up with the crew from  spring mountain racing  to put the 2021 corvette c8 to the test  [Music]  the corvette has been part of the fabric  of america for over 65 years and today  we're getting up close and personal with  a c8  this is shawn with chevrolet and sean  today i'm going to do a hot lap in the  c8 and it's not called a hot lap because  it's 115 degrees outside  what is a hot lap it is hot for sure but  what we're trying to show here is really  the riding handling capabilities of this  supercar  we're going to teach you how to be a  better driver on the track and on the  street on a day-to-day basis all right  before we get on the track let's do a  let's still walk through and kind of  introduce me to the corvette c8  this is an entirely new design eighth  generation corvette  mid engine car engine has never been in  the middle of the car it's always been  in the front  this has made the cockpit of the car  move forward just like a jet fighter  so you get better sight better control  better balance  great aerodynamics you can see some of  the jet fighter themes as you build the  car right here  how many horsepower in this z51 package  is 495 horse  0 to 60 in 2.9 seconds all right top  speed of about 180  i do feel like i'm sitting in a fighter  jet right now this is a really cool  setup  yeah as you can see the steering wheel  is set up for you know performance and  track  you've got your eight speed automatic  transmission we also have the paddle  shifts  right here okay right here here's your  actual gear right here so it's just push  button gear and then this is your driver  mode  weather tour sport or track so that  gives you four different modes there's  no shifter here so this is where i can  kind of rest my hand if i'm used to  holding a shifter in my car because  everything is done  right here it's that simple so if you  want to if you want to pretend you're in  a manual for example  push the manual button and there's your  paddles weather mode and you know you  get eco on this you can get 30 miles a  gallon on the freeway on this thing  traveling if you're in eco mode you put  it on the track it puts the exhaust  into play you've got all your safety  systems from stability control magnetic  ride control  everything now this is this paddle of  buttons right here what do we got here  yeah these are all your controls that  you're used to seeing on the dashboard  so the top half of it is the driver air  conditioning seat  auto and then the bottom part is for the  passenger and so  there's something here now these three  buttons here i think are just  genius because we have the front camera  i press that correct you can see that as  you're pulling up so if you're coming up  to a wall it will help guide you  to where to stop not only that you hit  the other button and the car has a two  inch lift so if you're coming in a  driveway for example that has a slight  increase the scraper  you can raise the front end once you do  it once it'll program itself  up to a thousand different gps locations  so next time you come to your home  it will automatically as you come up to  it it will rise so you do it you don't  have to do it every single time  every single sports car should have that  feature so many times i'm pulling in  somewhere  scrape scrape scrape or i'm pulling in a  parking lot i don't realize how close  the curb stop is  and hear the crunch this is a lifesaver  on the vehicle  absolutely absolutely all right how do  you take me on the hot lap no ricky's  going  rick bobby rick malone we call him ricky  bobby bobby's going to take me on my hot  lap but get ricky bobby over here let's  do this thing all right buddy rick  malone chief driver instructor and  driving school director for the ron  fellow performance driving school  and we're about to give jc a hot lap  right now all right you ready  let's do it here we go this is the  warm-up  on the brake i'm  [Music]  we're just riding here back into it this  is very smooth actually  extremely it's very smooth yeah  and we're gonna go through it again now  we got some heat in our tires and now  we're warmed up ready to go again  yeah now we're gonna do what we call  launch control launch control  this is launch control give me one  second oh i need to compose myself all  right  launch control what does that mean okay  the computer's gonna control the wheel  spin  i'm gonna put the brake pretty hard i'm  gonna floor the throttle uh-huh  absolutely really cool but here's the  thing these seats though i'm not sliding  around on this thing oh you're just  nice and comfortable look at this  amazing isn't it we put a 94.1  we sure can't keep your hands on the  wheel  [Music]  wow holy smokes and if you noticed  when you asked me to put the radio on it  didn't lose my composure because i  already had the information on the track  yeah i was about to turn the radio on  for you but it was already set to 94.1 i  was just testing ricky it's already set  what'd you think of your ride rick thank  you so much incredible  amazing car that's that's what you call  it hot lap everybody  it is hot outside and it's hot on the  lap thank you rick i appreciate it  i might do it again that was an awesome  day you can experience the power of the  corvette at spring mountain racing  in pahrump las vegas now

